ol>\n  </svg>\n  <header class=\"topbar\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <a class=\"wordmark\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Lotolipi home\">lotolipi<span>.</span></a>\n      <nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</a><a href=\"/#case-studies\">Case studies</a><a href=\"/lottolov\">Lottolov</a><a href=\"/resume\">Résumé</a><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n  <main id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n    <section class=\"hero wrap\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\">\n      <div class=\"current-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"label\">Shilpi Mishra · Product designer</p>\n      <h1 id=\"hero-title\"><span>I think like</span> <span><em>an editor.</em></span></h1>\n      <p class=\"hero-intro\">I started in editorial design, figuring out where a reader’s eye should land. Now I design tools for people who have to make a decision and get on with their day.</p>\n      <a class=\"hero-link\" href=\"#case-studies\">Explore my work</a>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"work\" id=\"case-studies\" aria-labelledby=\"studies-title\"><div class=\"wrap\"><header class=\"work-head\"><h2 id=\"studies-title\">Case studies<span>.</span></h2></header><div class=\"study-index\"><article><a href=\"/work/workatlas\"><img src=\"/assets/af12ccbc8a429751.png\" alt=\"WorkAtlas problem-framing board\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"label\">Enterprise workflows</p><h3>WorkAtlas</h3><p>When a task changes hands, who gets to edit it?</p><span class=\"inline-link\">Read the case study ↗</span></a></article><article><a href=\"/work/signal\"><img src=\"/assets/signal-brief.jpg\" alt=\"Signal decision brief comparing two demand signals\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"label\">Decision support</p><h3>Signal</h3><p>How do you make a launch decision when two studies tell different stories?</p><span class=\"inline-link\">Read the case study ↗</span></a></article><article><a href=\"/work/field-guide\"><img src=\"/field-guide/materials.webp\" alt=\"Sculptural indigo textile and a carved printing cylinder on a vermilion plinth\"><p class=\"label\">Visitor experience · Wayfinding</p><h3>Field Guide</h3><p>What can you see in 45 minutes, and what changes when you linger?</p><span class=\"inline-link\">Read the case study ↗</span></a></article></div><p class=\"social-context\"><a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lotologique/\">Follow @lotologique on Instagram ↗</a></p></div></section><section class=\"studio\" aria-labelledby=\"studio-title\">\n      <div class=\"wrap studio-grid\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"label\">Independent print studio</p>\n          <h2 id=\"studio-title\">Lottolov</h2><p class=\"section-copy\">Give me a W and I’ll draw a wisteria. Give me three cats and each gets its own personality. Lottolov is where I turn those ideas into prints.</p>\n          <a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"/lottolov\">Explore the artwork <svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#f7-arrow_up_right\"></use></svg></a>\n        </div>\n        <img data-home-studio src=\"/assets/3c0cbb8e8cb26e6a.png\" width=\"944\" height=\"704\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Lottolov print of a blue crescent moon above a textured botanical landscape.\">\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"about\" id=\"approach\" aria-labelledby=\"about-title\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <p id=\"about\" class=\"label\">About Shilpi</p>\n        <h2 id=\"about-title\">The part I keep <em>coming back to.</em></h2>\n        <p>In an annual report, a well-placed heading can save someone a page of searching. On a team board, it might be a name beside a blocked task. I like finding the small detail that lets someone carry on.</p>\n        <a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"/resume\">View résumé <svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#f7-arrow_up_right\"></use></svg></a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n  <footer class=\"footer\" id=\"contact\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <h2>Say <em>hello.</em></h2><p>Have a product role in mind? I’d love to hear what your team is building.</p>\n      <a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"mailto:smshilpi1@gmail.com\">smshilpi1@gmail.com <svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#f7-envelope\"></use></svg></a>\n      <nav class=\"social-identities\" aria-label=\"Instagram profiles\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lotologique/\"><span>Product logic</span><strong>@lotologique ↗</strong><small>Design findings, mini case studies and experiments.</small></a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lottolov/\"><span>Art & illustration</span><strong>@lottolov ↗</strong><small>Visual explorations, prints and everything art.</small></a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lotolipi/\"><span>Personal</span><strong>@lotolipi ↗</strong><small>Life beyond the work.</small></a></nav><div class=\"footer-end\">\n        <span>© 2026 Shilpi Mishra</span><a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy</a>\n        <a class=\"back-top\" href=\"#top\">Back to top <svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#f7-arrow_up\"></use></svg></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n  \n<script src=\"/assets/workatlas-demo.js\" defer></script>"